\/oudstokenssemantic\/multiplecolorsemantictoken","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example.","type":"text"}],"title":"Theme Orange","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","kind":"symbol","images":[{"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","type":"icon"}]}}}